# RMSD of each residue fitted on its own: v1's rmsd keeps an array's sets apart; in VIAL a def with a group parameter
# maps over the residues
# data: 1ALA-560ns.pdb
=== v1
rr = rmsd(residue(:));
=== vial
def fitted(r: group):
    return rmsd(r, at(r.xyz, frame=0), weights='mass')
rr = fitted(residue)
